"name": "Background"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0227", "domain": "bread recipe flowchart", "names": ["Dough", "Yeast", "Water", "Mix", "Rest", "Bake", "Cool"], "text": "Writing out my bread recipe as a flowchart so my kids can follow it. Dough is the first box. Connect Dough to Mix, and Yeast to Mix, and Water to Mix. Mix goes to Rest, then Rest goes to Bake. Hmm, Bake should be before Cool, right? Yes, so connect Bake to Cool. Make Rest blue because it's the waiting step. Put Cool at the far right. Is there a path from Water to Cool? How many steps are there? Which shape has the most connections? Make Yeast small. Undo the last change if the flow looks wrong. Rename Mix to Knead.", "wires": [{"span": "Connect Dough to Mix, and Yeast to Mix, and Water to Mix", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Dough,Yeast,Water", "to": "Mix"}}, {"span": "Mix goes to Rest, then Rest goes to Bake", "trigger": "goes to", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Mix,Rest,Bake", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "connect Bake to Cool", "trigger": "connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Bake", "to": "Cool"}}, {"span": "Make Rest blue", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Rest", "color": "blue"}}, {"span": "Put Cool at the far right", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Cool", "position": "right"}}, {"span": "Is there a path from Water to Cool", "trigger": "Is there a path", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Water", "to": "Cool"}}, {"span": "How many steps are there", "trigger": "How many steps", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}, {"span": "Which shape has the most connections", "trigger": "most connections", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}, {"span": "Make Yeast small", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Yeast", "size": "small"}}, {"span": "Undo the last change", "trigger": "Undo", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "undo"}}, {"span": "Rename Mix to Knead", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Mix", "name": "Knead"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0228", "domain": "office map for new hires", "names": ["Lobby", "Desk", "Meeting", "Kitchen", "Restroom"], "text": "Office map for the new hire orientation, I'm keeping it simple. Lobby is the entry, put it at the bottom center. Desk should be above the Lobby. Meeting is next to Desk, to the right. Kitchen and Restroom go on the left side. Connect Lobby to Desk and Lobby to Meeting. Make Kitchen teal. Is Restroom left of Desk? Which shape is closest to Lobby? Describe the whole map for the handbook. Oops, I meant the Kitchen to be big, make it large. Thanks, the new hires need this by Monday.", "wires": [{"span": "put it at the bottom center", "trigger": "put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Lobby", "position": "bottom"}}, {"span": "Desk should be above the Lobby", "trigger": "should be above", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Desk", "position": "above", "anchor": "Lobby"}}, {"span": "Meeting is next to Desk, to the right", "trigger": "is next to", "type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Meeting", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Desk"}}, {"span": "Kitchen and Restroom go on the left side", "trigger": "go on the left side", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Kitchen,Restroom", "position": "left"}}, {"span": "Connect Lobby to Desk and Lobby to Meeting", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Lobby", "to": "Desk,Meeting"}}, {"span": "Make Kitchen teal", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Kitchen", "color": "teal"}}, {"span": "Is Restroom left of Desk", "trigger": "left of", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Restroom", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Desk"}}, {"span": "Which shape is closest to Lobby", "trigger": "closest to", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Lobby", "superlative": "closest"}}, {"span": "Describe the whole map for the handbook", "trigger": "Describe", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "describe"}}, {"span": "make it large", "trigger": "make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Kitchen", "size": "large"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0229", "domain": "machine learning pipeline", "names": ["Input", "Filter", "Model", "Output", "Logs"], "text": "Okay, sketching a machine learning pipeline for the team wiki. Input goes to Filter, then to Model, then to Output. Connect them as a chain. Logs should get a copy from Model, so connect Model to Logs with a dashed line. Make Model purple. Is there a cycle in this pipeline? Put Output on the far right. What's the shortest path from Input to Logs? Which shape is the least connected? Rename Filter to Clean. Count the arrows in total. Thanks!", "wires": [{"span": "Connect them as a chain", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Input,Filter,Model,Output", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "connect Model to Logs with a dashed line", "trigger": "connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Model", "to": "Logs", "style": "dashed", "arrow": "none"}}, {"span": "Make Model purple", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Model", "color": "purple"}}, {"span": "Is there a cycle in this pipeline", "trigger": "Is there a cycle", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}, {"span": "Put Output on the far right", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Output", "position": "right"}}, {"span": "What's the shortest path from Input to Logs", "trigger": "shortest path", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Input", "to": "Logs"}}, {"span": "Which shape is the least connected", "trigger": "least connected", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "leastConnected"}}, {"span": "Rename Filter to Clean", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Filter", "name": "Clean"}}, {"span": "Count the arrows in total", "trigger": "Count the arrows", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "kind": "edge"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0230", "domain": "hospital discharge process", "names": ["Patient", "Triage", "Ward", "Icu", "Home"], "text": "This is for the hospital discharge process, my manager wants a simple diagram. Patient comes in and goes to Triage. Triage sends people to Ward or Icu. Connect Triage to Ward and Icu. Ward sends people home when they're ready, so connect Ward to Home. Make Icu red. Is Home reachable from Patient? Move Home to the bottom right corner. Which shape has the most connections? Describe the diagram for the audit. Thanks.", "wires": [{"span": "Patient comes in and goes to Triage", "trigger": "goes to", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Patient", "to": "Triage"}}, {"span": "Connect Triage to Ward and Icu", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Triage", "to": "Ward,Icu"}}, {"span": "connect Ward to Home", "trigger": "connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Ward", "to": "Home"}}, {"span": "Make Icu red", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Icu", "color": "red"}}, {"span": "Is Home reachable from Patient", "trigger": "Is Home reachable from", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Patient", "to": "Home"}}, {"span": "Move Home to the bottom right corner", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Home", "position": "bottomRight"}}, {"span": "Which shape has the most connections", "trigger": "most connections", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}, {"span": "Describe the diagram for the audit", "trigger": "Describe", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "describe"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0231", "domain": "radio check drill", "names": ["Alpha", "Bravo", "Charlie", "Delta", "Echo", "Foxtrot"], "text": "Hi, I'm making a diagram of our radio check procedure for the drill team. Alpha calls Bravo first. Bravo answers Charlie, and Charlie answers Delta. Connect Alpha to Bravo, Bravo to Charlie, and Charlie to Delta. Echo is the supervisor, so put Echo at the top center. Make Echo red. Foxtrot should be near Delta. Is there a path from Alpha to Foxtrot? Hmm, Foxtrot isn't linked yet. Connect Delta to Foxtrot with a dashed line. Which shape has the most connections? Move Charlie a bit to the left, around 30 pixels. Are Alpha and Echo directly linked? Duplicate Bravo twice for the backup radios. Rename Echo to Control. Undo the last thing if the chain looks broken. Thanks, I'll test it tomorrow.", "wires": [{"span": "Connect Alpha to Bravo, Bravo to Charlie, and Charlie to Delta", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Alpha,Bravo,Charlie,Delta", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "put Echo at the top center", "trigger": "put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Echo", "position": "top"}}, {"span": "Make Echo red", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Echo", "color": "red"}}, {"span": "Foxtrot should be near Delta", "trigger": "should be near", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Foxtrot", "position": "near", "anchor": "Delta"}}, {"span": "Is there a path from Alpha to Foxtrot", "trigger": "Is there a path", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Alpha", "to": "Foxtrot"}}, {"span": "Connect Delta to Foxtrot with a dashed line", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Delta", "to": "Foxtrot", "style": "dashed", "arrow": "none"}}, {"span": "Which shape has the most connections", "trigger": "most connections", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}, {"span": "Move Charlie a bit to the left, around 30 pixels", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Charlie", "direction": "left", "distance": "30"}}, {"span": "Are Alpha and Echo directly linked", "trigger": "directly linked", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Alpha", "anchor": "Echo"}}, {"span": "Duplicate Bravo twice", "trigger": "Duplicate", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Bravo", "count": "2"}}, {"span": "Rename Echo to Control", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Echo", "name": "Control"}}, {"span": "Undo the last thing", "trigger": "Undo", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "undo"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0232", "domain": "sprint board before standup", "names": ["Sprint", "Story1", "Story2", "Done", "Review"], "text": "Sprint board update for the standup, cleaning it up before 9am. Story1 and Story2 are in the sprint now. Move Story2 below Story1. Make Done green. Make Review yellow. Connect Story1 to Review and Story2 to Review. Connect Review to Done. Is Done connected to Sprint? Sprint should be at the top. Which shape has the fewest connections? Rename Story2 to Story2b, we split it. Duplicate Story1 once, one more story is coming. Count the shapes on the board. Thanks, the team needs this in 5 minutes.", "wires": [{"span": "Move Story2 below Story1", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Story2", "position": "below", "anchor": "Story1"}}, {"span": "Make Done green", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Done", "color": "green"}}, {"span": "Make Review yellow", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Review", "color": "yellow"}}, {"span": "Connect Story1 to Review and Story2 to Review", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Story1,Story2", "to": "Review"}}, {"span": "Connect Review to Done", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Review", "to": "Done"}}, {"span": "Is Done connected to Sprint", "trigger": "connected to", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Done", "anchor": "Sprint"}}, {"span": "Sprint should be at the top", "trigger": "should be at", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Sprint", "position": "top"}}, {"span": "Which shape has the fewest connections", "trigger": "fewest connections", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "leastConnected"}}, {"span": "Rename Story2 to Story2b", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Story2", "name": "Story2b"}}, {"span": "Duplicate Story1 once", "trigger": "Duplicate", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Story1"}}, {"span": "Count the shapes on the board", "trigger": "Count the shapes", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}]}
